Header set for Ubuntu 7.0.0-43/-44-generic kernels.

hda_local.h is copied from the Ubuntu kernel source (tag Ubuntu-7.0.0-44.44,
identical in Ubuntu-7.0.0-43.43). It differs from mainline v7.0 only by the
extra member "struct snd_kcontrol *share_spdif_kctl" in struct hda_multi_out,
which changes the layout of struct hda_gen_spec. Building against the mainline
header on these kernels would corrupt memory, so the header must match.
